        <!-- ================================================================
             SLOT 0 — stage id (SHORT_TEXT): "blue","red",...,"gps_error","".
             Full-face bounds so arc PartDraw coordinates are in watch space.
             Stage condition lives INSIDE this slot's own Complication context
             so [COMPLICATION.TEXT] (own-slot reference) is used — not the
             cross-slot [COMPLICATION_0.TEXT] that fails at Scene level.
             Arc progress uses [COMPLICATION_1.RANGED_VALUE_CURRENT] cross-slot
             (numeric cross-slot references are supported by the WFF runtime).
             ================================================================ -->
